      "message": "what happens if 2 regions aren\u0027t enough?\n\ne.g. CONFIG_MAPPED_STORAGE_BASE + CONFIG_RW_MEM_OFF \u003d\u003d 0x8000020 or something that had a small alignment\n\nI am sure that doesn\u0027t happen today, but what about in the future; what should happen here and how should it fail or handle it?",
