      "writtenOn": "2020-05-28T22:56:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case we would try to cover whatever is left in the second region. The second call to mpu_config_region at the end of this function will try subregions on the second region if necessary. That\u0027s our best effort: if subregions on the second region don\u0027t work then it\u0027s impossible to do it with 2 regions, we will get -EC_ERROR_INVAL. Since we don\u0027t want to use a third region, this is \"what should happen\".\n\nI updated the comment.",
